# AIDEV-NOTE: A key grants only two fixed forwards; it never grants a host or container shell.
Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /run/keys/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile /run/keys/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
AllowUsers forward
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
UsePAM no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
AllowTcpForwarding local
PermitOpen launch-api:3000 oauth-proxy:8080
PermitListen none
GatewayPorts no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTTY no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserEnvironment no
ForceCommand /bin/false
MaxAuthTries 2
MaxSessions 0
LoginGraceTime 20
MaxStartups 2:30:10
ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 2
LogLevel ERROR
